      "message": "I didn\u0027t understand the comment completely, could you help me with following questions:\n\nAt present we have a global variable `cbi`, which is point of reference for all APIs. Are you suggesting to have another buffer variable like it to store pieces of image temporarily at one place before writing at a time. Or to use existing `cbi` variable for this and ignore it\u0027s being unstable for a while\n\nIf we go with global variable specific for buffer, there won\u0027t be much memory space saving difference w.r.to current implementation as we have buffer array in function now\n\nThank you",
